      { "speaker": "Neha", "native": "നാളെ ശനിയാഴ്ചയല്ലേ? രാവിലെ ക്ലാസ് ഉണ്ട്.", "roman": "nāḷe shaniyāḻchayallē? rāvile klāsŭ uṇḍŭ.", "en": "Tomorrow's Saturday, isn't it? I have a class in the morning." },
      { "speaker": "Arun", "native": "ക്ലാസ് എപ്പോൾ കഴിയും?", "roman": "klāsŭ eppōḷ kaḻiyum?", "en": "When does the class finish?" },
