      { "speaker": "Neha", "native": "നാല് മണി വേണ്ട, നാലര ആക്കാം.", "roman": "nālŭ maṇi vēṇḍa, nālara ākkām.", "en": "Not four — let's make it half past four." },
      { "speaker": "Arun", "native": "ശരി. വൈകരുത്, കേട്ടോ!", "roman": "shari. vaikarutŭ, kēṭṭō!", "en": "OK. Don't be late, OK!" },
